SUMMARY:The Art of Islamic Illumination
DESCRIPTION:This 5-day course will take art lovers\, painters\, calligraphers and traditional art enthusiasts on an engaging journey. This course is essential for participants who enjoy learning about Islamic floral shapes\, which consist of stylized botanical forms of leaves and flowers&mdash\;the foundation of traditional Islamic illumination. In this hands-on course\, artists passionate about Islamic art will explore part of the history behind these shapes. They will learn and practice how to paint Islamic flowers on paper using gouache colors and shell gold. By the end of this course\, participants will create their own artwork\, which can be framed to decorate their space. This course will cover various t
LOCATION:Ithra - Ithra Tower - Level 7\, Art Studio
